%% title: Certificates: issue, duplicate, revoke
%% desc: Choose the kind, then give the details: language, detail boxes and the next serial number; everything except the transfer certificate can be issued to a whole class at once. See the preview, then print; the serial number is assigned on Print. A reprint keeps the same serial number, raises the copy number and prints the duplicate label. When an admin revokes with a reason, the QR page shows revoked and the register shows it with the reason.
flowchart TD
  K["Choose kind"]:::admin --> D["Details<br/>language · fields · next serial"]:::admin
  D --> P["Preview"]
  P --> PR["Print<br/>serial assigned here"]:::admin
  PR -.-> R["Reprint"]:::admin
  R --> R2["Same serial<br/>next copy · DUPLICATE label"]
  PR -.-> V["Revoke<br/>admin · reason required"]:::admin
  V --> Q["QR page shows revoked"]:::public
  V --> G["Register shows revoked<br/>with reason"]:::note
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef public fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
